<div class="card" style="max-width: 560px">
    <div class="card-head">
        <strong>Where the ticket goes</strong>
        <span class="badge badge-ai"><i class="ri-sparkling-2-line"></i>Decided by the agent</span>
    </div>
    <div class="card-body sedna-col sedna-gap-3">
        <ol class="workflow-decision" aria-label="Options the agent weighed">
            <li data-state="chosen">
                <span class="workflow-decision-option">Page the on-call engineer <span class="visually-hidden">(chosen)</span></span>
                <span class="meter"><span class="meter-fill" style="--value: 86%"></span></span>
                <span class="workflow-decision-score">0.86</span>
                <span class="workflow-decision-why">Three stores in one region within 15 minutes, out of hours: an outage, not a fault.</span>
            </li>
            <li data-state="rejected">
                <span class="workflow-decision-option">Queue for the network team</span>
                <span class="meter"><span class="meter-fill" style="--value: 31%"></span></span>
                <span class="workflow-decision-score">0.31</span>
                <span class="workflow-decision-why">The team starts at 07:00; the tills would be down for nine hours.</span>
            </li>
            <li data-state="rejected">
                <span class="workflow-decision-option">Close as a known issue</span>
                <span class="meter"><span class="meter-fill" style="--value: 8%"></span></span>
                <span class="workflow-decision-score">0.08</span>
            </li>
        </ol>
        <details class="reasoning">
            <summary><i class="ri-arrow-right-s-line reasoning-chevron"></i>Thought for 3 s</summary>
            <div class="reasoning-body">
                <p>One store losing its link is a fault for the morning. Three stores in the same region within a quarter of an hour is the regional uplink, and nobody can fix that from a store.</p>
                <p>It is 21:40 and the stores close at 22:00, but they open at 07:00 and cannot take cards until the link is back. That is worth waking someone for.</p>
            </div>
        </details>
    </div>
</div>
